            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune Rally is a colorful fantasy roguelike autobattler where every victory begins before the battle starts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Princess Elara has vanished beyond the broken border roads, and the kingdom’s army is too slow, scattered, and wounded to follow. You command a rally of heroes, outcasts, scouts, mages, knights, and oathbound defenders as they chase her trail through dangerous roads, cursed crossings, war camps, and the looming Black Banner Keep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your squad, choose your route, place your heroes, equip powerful gear, and then let the battle unfold. Your heroes fight automatically, but your decisions shape everything. A tank in the wrong tile can fall early. A protected caster can turn a fight. A backline strike, a healing relic, or one smart upgrade can save the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run offers new choices:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft heroes with different classes, roles, and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position your squad on a tactical battle board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip weapons, armor, and trinkets that change combat outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose rewards after victories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit shops, taverns, mystery events, and dangerous elite fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover relics that alter your whole squad for the rest of the run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Elara’s trail across story episodes with illustrated scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune Rally is easy to understand, but built for clever decisions. Put sturdy heroes in front, keep fragile damage dealers safe, chase class synergies, adapt to enemy formations, and make each reward choice count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road east is broken. The princess is not waiting quietly. Rally your heroes and fight your way to the truth.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune Rally is a colorful fantasy roguelike autobattler where every victory begins before the battle starts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Princess Elara has vanished beyond the broken border roads, and the kingdom’s army is too slow, scattered, and wounded to follow. You command a rally of heroes, outcasts, scouts, mages, knights, and oathbound defenders as they chase her trail through dangerous roads, cursed crossings, war camps, and the looming Black Banner Keep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your squad, choose your route, place your heroes, equip powerful gear, and then let the battle unfold. Your heroes fight automatically, but your decisions shape everything. A tank in the wrong tile can fall early. A protected caster can turn a fight. A backline strike, a healing relic, or one smart upgrade can save the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run offers new choices:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft heroes with different classes, roles, and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position your squad on a tactical battle board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip weapons, armor, and trinkets that change combat outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose rewards after victories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit shops, taverns, mystery events, and dangerous elite fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover relics that alter your whole squad for the rest of the run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Elara’s trail across story episodes with illustrated scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune Rally is easy to understand, but built for clever decisions. Put sturdy heroes in front, keep fragile damage dealers safe, chase class synergies, adapt to enemy formations, and make each reward choice count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road east is broken. The princess is not waiting quietly. Rally your heroes and fight your way to the truth.</p>",
